WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:07.080
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and the Walking
Dead finale totally delivered on the wtf and

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.670
left things in such an unexpected cliffhanger
moment that we’re all forced to bookmark

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.870
season 5 episode 1 in our calendars.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:18.230
A lot of the big things we expected went down
but there were a few surprises.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:24.050
Mostly what that cliffhanger ended up being,
and the final body count at the end of the

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:25.050
episode.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.050
Quick shoutout for my giveaway.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:32.739
Since I just hit a hundred and fifty thousand
subscribers, I’m going to give away three

00:00:32.739 --> 00:00:35.690
amazon gift cards to random subscribers in
the comments.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:43.260
Just leave a comment on this video and I’ll
announce the winners in my Q&amp;A video tomorrow.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:50.210
So let’s wade right in to the blood with
top 5 moments and then a post mortem review.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.780
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:56.010
Here we go, Number 5 - Hershel flashbacks.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:59.770
If you had trouble pinpointing when these
scenes were happening, it was basically in

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:03.800
the time between the Season 3 finale and the
start of Season 4.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.440
About two months after Woodbury.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.830
I loved the Hershel and Patrick cameos, may
the rest in pieces.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:13.570
The bigger theme of the episode was “Who
Am I?”

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.470
Carl even said it himself, “Who are We?”

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:19.920
I felt like they were foreshadowing Rick’s
line from the comics when he says “We Are

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:20.920
The Walking Dead”.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:21.920
But it never came.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.700
Maybe next season when we see the second half
of the cliffhanger.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:30.390
Who else laughed when Patrick made the comment
about legos being for kids and they panned

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.970
over to Carl cleaning his gun like a pro.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:37.250
Chandler Riggs has grown a lot since season
3 so he looked way different.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.920
I’d bet they waited till recently to shoot
these scenes rather than shoot them at the

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.920
beginning of the season.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:47.840
Did anyone else feel like it was almost Hershel’s
fault that Rick became ineffectual Farmer

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:52.810
Rick, the one Carl got so mad at for not being
the badass he was in this episode.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:57.760
It was noble, I don’t blame him or anything,
but you could see how much Hershel was convincing

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:02.270
him to start living like a pacifist and less
like the monster Michonne and Carl talked

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:05.979
about later.

00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:08.110
Number 4 - I’m Just Another Monster Too

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:10.630
Carl and Michonne’s talk was so brutal.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:14.640
Especially when Michonne explained the rest
of her origin story with her son Andre and

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:15.640
Mike and Terry.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.060
It was hard to tell whether she turned them
into pets to punish them or punish herself

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:22.170
for not being there to save them.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.130
I really think she was punishing herself.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:30.920
It was nice that she acknowledged the mechanics
of using walker pets as camouflage.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:36.380
Carl really just explained what all the tension
between him and Rick has been about lately,

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.510
it’s really that Carl has felt like he’s
turning into a monster and isn’t the “legos

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.709
type” that Rick wants him to be.

00:02:43.709 --> 00:02:52.819
This was really true for almost everyone in
the episode, am I a monster or am I a lego

00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:55.110
fanboy/fangirl.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:58.340
Feel free to let me know which one you are
in the comments.

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:00.650
Number 3 - Welcome to Terminus, to watch,
firefight

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:05.320
There are times when characters do crazy stupid
things and there are times when you feel so

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:09.000
proud for how careful they’re being.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.740
I was proud of Rick for this entire episode,
you can clearly tell that he has learned from

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.830
past events and isn’t going to trust anyone
ever again.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.910
Thus the backdoor entry.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:23.040
I felt like that idea, you can’t trust anyone
was just hammered home when they passed through

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:27.590
that creepy shrine and it said “Never again,
Never Trust”.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:33.740
As much as Terminus has been a mystery, I
don’t think that any of us thought these

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.740
were good people.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.060
Even when we finally met Gareth.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:42.310
He was just way too disarming, he’s totally
not the governor.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:46.550
Scott Gimple and Robert Kirkman made a big
point of saying that there would be no Negan

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:49.570
or other big bad like them for a long time.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:52.520
But Gareth does seem like the leader.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:57.300
I can’t say it enough though, Rick was on
his shit in this episode.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.859
Eyes of the hawk, no bullshit.

00:03:58.859 --> 00:04:01.319
Where did you get that watch?!

00:04:01.319 --> 00:04:03.800
Number 2 - The Survivors are Reunited in Traincar
A

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:09.150
The biggest surprise here was that everyone
is still okay, with all their limbs.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:12.080
Asterisk, where the eff is Beth?

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.750
For now we can just say everyone is still
in the condition the entered in.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:19.829
Let me know if you disagree, but can we all
just say what we’re thinking...cannibals.

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:24.729
I actually cheered when Rick slapped that
plate out of Carl’s hands.

00:04:24.729 --> 00:04:26.720
Don’t eat the people meats.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.120
You can never come back from that.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.550
This isn’t an episode of Hannibal!

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:34.340
We won’t get confirmation till Season 5,
but I’m expecting them to tie everything

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.280
up in that first episode.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.370
Which is only seven months away.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:42.690
No big deal, we can all just write terminus
fan fiction until then.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.790
No creepy cannibal sex stuff though.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.810
Speaking of which...

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:50.130
my Number WTF moment 1 - Joe’s Group Are
the Marauders from the Comics

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:53.010
So it went down almost exactly how we expected.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:57.610
If you’re not familiar with the comics,
in issue 57 the marauders were a couple of

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:03.300
people that sexually assaulted Carl and tried
to kill them and Rick bit a giant hunk out

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.180
of one of their necks and then brutally revenge
killed the one that assaulted Carl.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.360
The one difference was that shot of Michonne
holding Carl.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:14.580
It’s exactly like the panel in the comic,
except it was Abraham holding him.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.280
Even though I thought this would happen it
was still hard to watch.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:24.910
I liked the way they showed us that first
moment after, Rick in shock and then jumped

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.120
back to the beginning.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:32.790
Did anyone else think it was strange that
Rick seemed so fazed in that moment, then

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.520
when Daryl sat down, he seemed totally fine.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.919
Red beard full of blood.

00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:41.040
I wanted to start calling him redbeard, like
he was a different character.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.419
Because he feels so much more action oriented
and driven than he has in the last couple

00:05:46.419 --> 00:05:47.419
of episodes.

00:05:47.419 --> 00:05:52.020
He says the same thing Tyreese said to Carol
after the whole Lizzie WTF episode.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:55.139
We do what we do because of them.

00:05:55.139 --> 00:06:00.199
When Rick said it he was talking about Carl
specifically, Tyreese was talking about Judith.

00:06:00.199 --> 00:06:02.240
So now it’s your turn to let it all out,
let me know what your biggest WTF moment was

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.420
in the comments.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.300
Was it the Marauders or was it the cliffhanger?

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:13.370
I’ll be doing season 5 predictions tomorrow
in addition to my Q&amp;A video, so we can talk

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:17.360
about the fate of Beth and the Terminus Cannibals.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:20.770
Here’s a quick post mortem on the finale
and season 4 as a whole.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.870
Let me stop my hands from shaking a little
bit.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:26.990
Overall I give the finale and A just for character
development.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:31.080
Of course I was disappointed that they left
so many big questions unanswered, where is

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:35.310
Beth when are they going to reveal all the
cannibalism, who is going to die next?

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:39.420
But that’s what a really good series does,
it demands that you continue watching.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.350
So I will give them props for ending it on
such a high moment.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:47.800
The thing that stuck out most was Rick, not
just because of his WTF moment with the Marauders,

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.900
but because he’s either reset to that person
right at the beginning of the flashbacks,

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.810
that Rick right after the Woodbury battle.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.970
Or he’s more of a monster than ever.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:07:00.690
So far he still seems like he has a grip on
reality and I was really satisfied with the

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.590
way he handled the Terminus situation.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.919
There’s nothing they could have done.

00:07:04.919 --> 00:07:08.220
It looked like they had at least 50 people
with rifles pointed at them.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:13.620
And a leader, an archer a samurai and a kid
can only kill so many people at once.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:18.590
Was anyone else bummed Gareth didn’t give
Carl a cool nickname too?

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:23.520
That last moment with Rick is a good preview
for what the survivors will be like in season

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.520
5.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.240
No more bullshit, no more farming.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.610
Just straight up ass kicking.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:32.040
I know a lot of you guys commented on how
weak you thought this season was after all

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.669
the crazy action during season 3.

00:07:33.669 --> 00:07:36.460
I mean, it’s hard to top a walker head aquarium.

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:41.759
That’s why I feel like season 4 had to be
this story where all the characters realized

00:07:41.759 --> 00:07:45.229
that they can’t go back to being normal
people, never again.

00:07:45.229 --> 00:07:46.590
They come first.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:51.250
It sets them up in a nice dicotomy with the
creepy Terminus cult.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.070
Let me know what your final thoughts are and
post all the questions you want me to include

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.930
in the Q&amp;A and let me know what you want to
talk about most in my Season 5 predictions

00:07:58.930 --> 00:07:59.930
video.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.759
Like i said, i’ll try to post both of those
tomorrow.

00:08:01.759 --> 00:08:08.039
Right now click here for the Q&amp;A and click
here for the rest of my season 4 videos in

00:08:08.039 --> 00:08:13.870
case you need to rewind for a sec.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.099
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:08:16.099 --> 00:08:16.749
High Fives!

